KGE-LLM public research code

This package contains the author-maintained KGE-LLM model, training entry
point, split/audit utilities, and a legacy MCC5-THU adapter. It derives from the
Apache-2.0-licensed Time-LLM codebase; see LICENSE.

The classification losses are maintained separately from upstream forecasting
losses. Unused N-BEATS-derived MAPE, sMAPE and MASE implementations, carrying
their own non-commercial notice in the upstream Time-LLM loss file, are excluded
from this classification release. Their original terms continue to apply to
copies retained in earlier repository history; this release does not relicense
those historical copies.

The retained optional M4 loader in data_provider/m4.py carries the original
Element AI copyright and CC BY-NC 4.0 notice in that file. It is not relicensed
under Apache 2.0 and is not used by the BJTU classification entry point.

Pretrained language-model weights, datasets, trained checkpoints, cached
features, experiment logs, raw predictions, manuscript sources, internal
orchestration scripts, and third-party baseline implementations are not part
of this package.
